1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,040
Stick your fingers in your ears...

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,097
and talk.

3
00:00:03,097 --> 00:00:04,460
Hellooo?

4
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,400
Deep, right?

5
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:06,670
That's your skull...

6
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:07,967
singing bass.

7
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,055
Every word you say

8
00:00:09,055 --> 00:00:10,833
makes your bones hum.

9
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,321
Normally, that low hum

10
00:00:12,321 --> 00:00:14,000
leaks out your ears.

11
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,500
Fingers in?

12
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:16,715
It's trapped...

13
00:00:16,715 --> 00:00:17,673
so it booms

14
00:00:17,673 --> 00:00:18,403
right into

15
00:00:18,403 --> 00:00:19,700
your eardrum.

16
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:20,763
Same reason your voice

17
00:00:20,763 --> 00:00:21,500
sounds boomy

18
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,933
with earbuds in.

19
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:23,933
Now press harder.

20
00:00:23,933 --> 00:00:25,400
That faint rumble?

21
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,950
Your own muscles...

22
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:27,398
buzzing

23
00:00:27,398 --> 00:00:29,967
twenty-five times a second.

24
00:00:30,021 --> 00:00:30,796
You're basically

25
00:00:30,796 --> 00:00:32,936
a walking subwoofer.

